{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/926133-court-contracts-affinities-or-no","id":926133,"title":"Court Contracts: Affinities or no?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-07-04T16:18:37-07:00","id":926133,"title":"Court Contracts: Affinities or no?","content":"I have posted another thread related to this, but I've been in the process of making my own custom freehold for Changeling 2e, and I was wondering about making court contracts for them. It is early days for them, but I was wondering if Court based contracts should have affinities or not. As of the time of this writing, the only examples that I have are from the Dark Eras book, which do not have requirements for Mantle, and the ones in the Court of the Road PDF which was posted on this forum somewhere, but I cannot find it again. The contracts from Dark Eras do have Seeming Affinities, but there are other contracts within the book that do not, and the ones for the Court of the Road likewise do not. Thus, I am a little confused on what examples to draw from.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-05T10:25:15-07:00","id":926491,"title":"","content":"I think only David Hill or Arc could help you I'm afraid. I have no idea.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"d